<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the end of trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day  and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3402.60, 47.88 points or 1.43 percent higher than Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
